      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<div class=\"documentEditable\">\r\n<div id=\"content\">\r\n<div id=\"content-core\">\r\n<div class=\"field ArchetypesField-TextField\" id=\"archetypes-fieldname-text-724e78d7ba2d45a5a5b8ebb9b2c961d1\">\r\n<div id=\"parent-fieldname-text-724e78d7ba2d45a5a5b8ebb9b2c961d1\">\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><em>Na\u1e2b\u015feb</em>:\u00a0It is the city in\u00a0<em data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"49\">M\u0101ver\u0101\u02be\u00fc\u2019n-Nehr</em>\u00a0that they call\u00a0<em data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"72\">Nesef</em>. There is a well there in which a moon can be seen. They say it is charming, and they call it the Well of Nakhshab (<em data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"226\">\u00c7\u0101h-\u0131 Na\u1e2b\u015feb</em>). [translation]</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"viewlet-below-content-body\">\r\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"documentActions\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
